# Report 033, phase P5: the CLI page by touch only (no keyboard: the launcher's input.state says none, the shared rule lets the
# on-screen keyboard show for the entry once it is tapped). The real bundled meshcore-cli (MESHHOP_MESHCLI) on Mesh Hop's relay
# against the simulated board. Tools > CLI by taps (0.7.0), a tap on the entry brings the keyboard (at 640x480 only the entry stays
# above it, the caption shows the line meshcore-cli is on), its keys type, Enter sends and the keyboard goes (the answer shows),
# Help by its button, a command row tapped twice goes into the entry; 0.7.2: no To... button (the entry has its room); the header's
# Esc leaves (Tools is back), again: Home. Run by cli_run.sh.
keyboard off
wait 6000
expect text "Tools"
tap "Tools"
tap "Tools"
wait 800
expect text "CLI"
tap "CLI"
tap "CLI"
waitstate cli running 40000
waitcli "SimNode> " 5000
say == the console by touch (expect cli=running cli_typing=0 osk=down)
dump
shot clit01-prompt
check cli-touch
tapfield 1
wait 900
expect osk on
say == the entry with the on-screen keyboard (expect osk=up typing=cli; at 640x480 cli_out=0: only the entry above it)
dump
shot clit02-keyboard
check cli-keyboard
tapkey "v"
tapkey "e"
tapkey "r"
waitstate cli_entry ver 1000
shot clit03-typed
key enter
wait 900
expect osk off
waitcli "Version: v1.15.0" 15000
say == sent: the keyboard went, the answer shows (expect osk=down cli_typing=0 cli_out=1)
dump
shot clit04-answer
check cli-answer
# Help by its button; a command row: the first tap selects it, the second puts it into the entry
tap "Help"
waitstate cli_help 1 2000
shot clit05-help
check cli-help-touch
tap "to <name>"
tap "to <name>"
waitstate cli_help 0 2000
waitstate cli_entry "to " 1000
shot clit06-inserted
# 0.7.2: no To... button any more: the bar is the entry and Help (a repeater is picked in Contacts > it > More > Open in CLI)
expect notext "Toâ¦"
shot clit06b-no-to-button
check cli-bar-touch
# the header's Esc: back to Tools (the session ends, Mesh Hop resumes), again: Home
tap "Esc"
waitstate tab Tools 3000
waitstate cli off 2000
waitstate relay off 8000
dump
tap "Esc"
waitstate home 1 3000
dump
shot clit07-home-after
